{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_061", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价也够离谱的。这波操作，是不是在试探市场反应？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_062", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和科技配置可能不低，但15800元确实偏高。建议等官方公布详细配置后再做判断。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_063", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福，但家长压力也大啊。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_064", "text": "一万五的儿童车，不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌呢！", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_065", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，容易养成攀比心理，不利于孩子成长。家长应该理性消费。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_066", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但看到这个价格直接劝退。希望官方能给出合理的定价。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_067", "text": "问界M9的儿童版，1:1复刻，可能包含了一些智能驾驶辅助功能，成本确实高。但15800元还是有点虚高。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_068", "text": "前排围观，看看这车到底能卖多少辆，会不会成为新一代理财产品？", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_069", "text": "高端儿童车市场兴起，反映了消费升级，但也可能加剧社会阶层分化。我们需要思考如何平衡商业利益与社会责任。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_070", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障，价格高一点也正常。支持国货，期待正式发布！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_071", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价就够离谱了。这波操作，是不是在试探市场底线？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_072", "text": "从商业逻辑看，儿童车定价需考虑成本、品牌溢价和市场接受度。15800元若为真，可能定位高端礼品市场，但需官方明确配置和售后。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_073", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福。但一万五对普通家庭来说，还是太贵了。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_074", "text": "一万五的儿童车，开出去就是整条街最靓的仔！不过，这价格够买辆二手奥拓了，不如直接给孩子买辆真车？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_075", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是在收割家长的焦虑？孩子要的是陪伴，不是昂贵的玩具。这种消费主义风气要不得。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_076", "text": "作为家长，本来想给孩子买个好点的儿童车，但15800元实在超出预算。希望官方能给出合理定价，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_077", "text": "问界M9儿童车1:1复刻，但儿童车需要符合安全标准，比如速度限制、材质环保等。高价不一定等于高品质，建议家长理性消费。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_078", "text": "前排围观，看看这波定价最后怎么收场。反正我买不起，就看看热闹。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_079", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层和资源分配不均。这不仅是商业问题，更值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}, {"comment_id": "comment_080", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障。虽然价格不菲，但支持国货，希望物有所值。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 2, "generation_trigger": "official_statement"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_081", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价难道不是官方默许的吗？这种模糊表态，怕不是想试探市场反应吧。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_082", "text": "从成本角度看，1:1复刻M9的儿童车，如果包含智能驾驶、材质和工艺，15800元并非离谱。但最终定价需看配置，建议等官方发布。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_083", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福。但一万五对普通家庭来说还是太贵了，希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_084", "text": "一万五的儿童车，开出去就是整条街最靓的仔！不过，这价格够我买辆二手奥拓了，哈哈。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_085", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，简直是在挑战社会公平底线！有钱人的玩具，却让普通家庭的孩子眼红，这种消费主义风气该刹一刹了。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_086", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格真的心凉。孩子喜欢问界M9，但一万五的儿童车我们根本买不起，感觉被品牌方当韭菜割了。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_087", "text": "科普一下：儿童电动车通常需要符合GB6675玩具安全标准，如果这款车真的1:1复刻，可能涉及外观专利和尺寸问题，但具体要看官方参数。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_088", "text": "前排围观，坐等官方打脸。这价格一出，估计又是一波热搜，我就看看有多少人买得起。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_089", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会贫富差距和消费分层。这种产品可能加剧儿童间的攀比心理，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_090", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障。虽然价格不菲，但这是中国智造的骄傲，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_091", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价也够离谱的。这波操作是不是在试探市场反应？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_092", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和设计可能确实有溢价，但15800元是否合理还需官方公布详细配置和定价依据。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_093", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候的玩具车才几十块，现在孩子的东西越来越贵，普通家庭怎么承受得起？", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_094", "text": "15800的儿童车，不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌呢！", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_095", "text": "给孩子买这么贵的车，是炫富还是真爱？价值观都扭曲了，不如把钱捐给贫困儿童。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_096", "text": "作为家长，我本来想给孩子买一辆，但看到这个价格直接劝退。希望官方能给出合理的定价，别让普通家庭望而却步。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_097", "text": "儿童电动车市场一般价格在几百到几千元，15800元确实属于高端定位。但问界M9本身售价不菲，儿童车复刻其外观，成本可能确实较高。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_098", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方正式售价，看看这波是割韭菜还是真香。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_099", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是消费主义对儿童领域的渗透，值得警惕。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_100", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障，价格高一点也正常，支持国货！", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 3, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_101", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价也够离谱了。这价格都能买辆不错的二手汽车了，儿童车再高端也不至于吧。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_102", "text": "从成本角度看，1:1复刻M9的外观，加上华为的智能技术，成本可能确实不低。但15800元是否合理，需要看具体配置和用料。建议等官方公布详细参数后再做判断。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_103", "text": "看到这个价格，想起小时候只能玩几十块的玩具车，现在的孩子真幸福。不过这个价格对普通家庭来说还是太高了，希望官方能出个亲民版。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_104", "text": "15800？我以为是1580呢！这价格是给车装了个火箭发动机吗？还是说买儿童车送M9？哈哈，开个玩笑，不过这个价格确实让人望而却步。", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_105", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是有点过度消费了？家长应该理性对待，不要盲目攀比。给孩子买玩具，安全和教育意义才是最重要的。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_106", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格真的有点生气。我们不是不愿意为孩子花钱，但也要花得值。希望官方能明确价格，别让销售人员乱报价，误导消费者。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_107", "text": "问界M9本身售价就在50万左右，儿童车1:1复刻，如果材质和工艺都向真车看齐，成本确实不低。但15800元是否包含华为智能系统？建议官方公布详细配置清单。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_108", "text": "前排吃瓜，坐等官方打脸。这价格要是真的，估计又是一波割韭菜。不过话说回来，有钱人的世界我们不懂，说不定真有人买呢。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_109", "text": "高端儿童车定价过高，反映的是社会消费分层问题。当儿童玩具都开始奢侈品化，普通家庭的育儿成本会进一步增加，这值得我们深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_110", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质肯定有保障。虽然价格不菲，但一分钱一分货，支持国产品牌推出高端产品，让世界看到中国智造的实力。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_111", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价也够离谱了，这波操作是不是在试探市场底线？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_112", "text": "从成本角度看，儿童车用料和设计可能确实有溢价，但15800元是否合理还需官方公布详细配置和成本构成。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_113", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格真的心凉，本来想给孩子买个好点的玩具，现在感觉被割韭菜了。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_114", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合出品，这儿童车怕不是要成为新一代‘理财产品’？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_115", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，是不是有点本末倒置？孩子的快乐不应该用金钱来衡量。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_116", "text": "官方声明含糊其辞，只说不是正式售价，那到底多少钱？能不能给个准信？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "矛盾激化派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_117", "text": "其实儿童电动车市场也有高端产品，比如一些进口品牌，但价格也没这么夸张，问界这波定价确实让人看不懂。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_118", "text": "支持国货，但也要理性消费，希望官方能给出合理的定价，不要辜负消费者的信任。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_119", "text": "这价格都够买一辆二手QQ了，给小孩买个玩具车，至于吗？", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_120", "text": "从社会角度看，高端儿童玩具的兴起反映了消费升级，但也可能加剧攀比心理，值得深思。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 4, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
{"event_id": "event_wenjie_001", "step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion", "comment_count": 20, "comments": [{"comment_id": "comment_121", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格真的有点心凉。本来想给孩子买个好点的玩具，但这么贵，普通家庭根本承受不起。", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_122", "text": "15800？不如直接买辆二手QQ，还能上牌呢！这儿童车是镶了金边还是能自动驾驶？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_123", "text": "企业定价自由，但也要考虑社会影响。儿童产品如此高价，容易助长攀比之风，不利于孩子价值观培养。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_124", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，技术含量应该不低，但儿童车毕竟不是必需品，定价过高可能影响市场接受度。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_125", "text": "这价格，我选择观望。等官方正式发布再说，说不定有惊喜呢。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_126", "text": "高端儿童车市场确实存在，但定价应更亲民。希望企业能兼顾社会责任，不要只盯着利润。", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_127", "text": "支持国产品牌创新，但价格要合理。希望官方能给出详细说明，让消费者明明白白消费。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_128", "text": "看到这个价格，我第一反应是：这车是给富豪家孩子准备的吧？普通家庭只能看看了。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_129", "text": "官方说不是正式售价，但销售人员透露的参考价也够离谱了。这波操作是不是在试探市场反应？", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_130", "text": "儿童车卖这么贵，不如买辆二手QQ，还能上牌呢！这价格是镶了金边还是能自动驾驶？", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_131", "text": "作为家长，看到这个价格真的心凉。本来想给孩子买个好点的玩具，结果连参考价都这么高，普通家庭怎么承受？", "profile_id": 6, "profile_label": "利益相关的受害者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_132", "text": "15800元？不如直接买辆二手QQ，还能带着孩子兜风呢！", "profile_id": 4, "profile_label": "玩世不恭的段子手", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_133", "text": "企业定价自由，但也要考虑社会影响。儿童产品高价化可能加剧攀比心理，不利于孩子成长。", "profile_id": 5, "profile_label": "道德捍卫的审判官", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_134", "text": "华为和赛力斯联合设计，品质应该有保障，但价格确实偏高。希望官方能给出合理的定价，让更多孩子体验科技乐趣。", "profile_id": 10, "profile_label": "朴素爱国拥趸", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "positive", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "support", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_135", "text": "儿童电动车市场从几百到几千都有，问界M9儿童车定位高端，15800元可能只是市场细分策略，不必过度解读。", "profile_id": 7, "profile_label": "博闻强识的科普君", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_136", "text": "这价格，我选择观望。等官方正式发布再说，现在讨论为时过早。", "profile_id": 8, "profile_label": "吃瓜不嫌事大的围观者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "吃瓜派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_137", "text": "儿童产品高价化反映的是消费升级，但也可能加剧阶层分化。我们是否该反思，孩子的快乐是否需要用金钱来衡量？", "profile_id": 9, "profile_label": "忧国忧民的沉思者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "questioning", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_138", "text": "作为家长，我理解企业追求利润，但儿童产品更应注重安全性和教育性，而不是用高价来彰显身份。", "profile_id": 3, "profile_label": "共情共鸣的叙事者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "情绪激进派", "orientation": "opinion", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_139", "text": "官方说15800只是参考价，但参考价都这么高，正式价还能低到哪去？怕不是又要收割一波智商税。", "profile_id": 1, "profile_label": "愤世嫉俗的批判者", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "negative", "faction": "观点输出派", "orientation": "questioning", "stance": "criticism", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}, {"comment_id": "comment_140", "text": "理性看待，儿童电动车市场细分，高端产品定价高也正常。但建议官方明确配置和售后，让消费者明明白白消费。", "profile_id": 2, "profile_label": "理性客观的分析师", "topic": "新闻时事", "emotion": "neutral", "faction": "表态判断派", "orientation": "fact", "stance": "neutral", "introduced_step": 5, "generation_trigger": "ongoing_discussion"}]}
